+			 * every device in /proc/partitions and therefore
+			 * always hits boot0.
+			 *
+			 * Not creating the devices keeps them out of
+			 * /proc/partitions, so nothing can probe them. The
+			 * real bug is somewhere in the mmc/msdc path and is
+			 * still unidentified; this only buys a bootable
+			 * system in the meantime.
+			 */
